  "features": "",
  "practiceLog": "",
  "miscNotes1": "Faith miracles:\nBoon—Ob 2. Make any ability open-ended until end of scene.\nBlessing—Ob 3. Add 1D to any ability for one test or series.\nAid—Ob 4. Add margin of success to any ability except Reflexes, Circles, Mortal Wound or Resources.\nHindrance—Ob 4. Cause creature to hesitate for two actions.\nGuidance—Ob 5. Ask Tudom to guide your way!\nMinor Miracle—Ob 5. Bring light, break spells, heal the wounded, mend the blade.\nPurification—Ob 5. Drive out spirits and demons of Strength or Will of B5 or less.",
